<title>INDONESIA: Gadjah Tunggal H1 net edges up.</title>
<headline>Gadjah Tunggal H1 net edges up.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>(in billion rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>				   June 30, 1996    June 30, 1995</p>
<p>    Net profit			   58.85 vs 50.20</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (in rupiah)    72 vs 63</p>
<p>    Net sales			   423.77 vs 324.65</p>
<p>    Operating profit		   74.21 vs 46.93</p>
<p>Note: PT Gadjah Tunggal is among Indonesia's largest tyre firms.</p>
</text>
